    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[What happens when there are no docs, no resources, and you're in uncharted territory? See problem-solving from a new angle as I show what I learned solving obscure, unique, and fascinating problems to bend an obsolete game engine into a model railroad simulator.]]></Value>
